<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Sonae buys shops from Sears.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Sonae buys shops from Sears.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sonae Investimentos-SGPS SA Retalho Especializado SGPS, a unit of Portuguese retailer Sonae Investimentos, bought &quot;The Source&quot;, a chain of shops that sells decorative articles for the home, from Britain's Sears Plc, Sonae said in a statement.</p>
